    "Raef": 40
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7323301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Raef",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330101": {
            "id": "732330101",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Agh, there's just no time at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330102"
            ]
          },
          "732330102": {
            "id": "732330102",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "And no one will swap shifts with me, either. What do I do now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330103"
            ]
          },
          "732330103": {
            "id": "732330103",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Eh? Traveler? Um... Traveler, please hold on a moment!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330104"
            ]
          },
          "732330104": {
            "id": "732330104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's going on?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330105"
            ]
          },
          "732330105": {
            "id": "732330105",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I'm sorry for taking up your time, but I'd like to ask you if you're free... and if you could do me a favor...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330107",
              "732330109"
            ]
          },
          "732330107": {
            "id": "732330107",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "You'd help me! Thank you! Thank you so much!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330111"
            ]
          },
          "732330111": {
            "id": "732330111",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Here's the situation: I ordered a flower pot from Azalai's shop, alongside a batch of seeds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330112"
            ]
          },
          "732330112": {
            "id": "732330112",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Originally, I had asked a friend to help me get them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330113"
            ]
          },
          "732330113": {
            "id": "732330113",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "But he suddenly told me that he had a mission to attend to and wouldn't have time to help me out. There was too little time for me to find someone else...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330114"
            ]
          },
          "732330114": {
            "id": "732330114",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "So Traveler, could you please help me collect my purchases from Azalai's? I hear that he should be at the entrance to the village right now, waiting for goods to come in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330115"
            ]
          },
          "732330115": {
            "id": "732330115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What did you buy all this stuff for, anyway?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330116"
            ]
          },
          "732330116": {
            "id": "732330116",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "They're for my girlfriend, Nermin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330117"
            ]
          },
          "732330117": {
            "id": "732330117",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "She's in poor health, so she's been convalescing at home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330118"
            ]
          },
          "732330118": {
            "id": "732330118",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I mean, you've seen it too. Aaru Village is in the middle of the desert, so there's not much greenery to go around. Can't say this is the best environment, can you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330119"
            ]
          },
          "732330119": {
            "id": "732330119",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "So I bought some plants to place in her house, but always staying in her room has kept her in a bad mood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330120"
            ]
          },
          "732330120": {
            "id": "732330120",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I'm also very busy at work, so I basically can't go to see her in the day. We only have time to talk to each other at night...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330121"
            ]
          },
          "732330121": {
            "id": "732330121",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "That's why I thought that perhaps I could get her to raise some flowers herself, if only just to help pass the time and take her mind off her illness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330122"
            ]
          },
          "732330122": {
            "id": "732330122",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I didn't expect things to get complicated like this..."
          },
          "732330109": {
            "id": "732330109",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Eh? Well... I do have some savings, so you don't have to worry about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330110"
            ]
          },
          "732330110": {
            "id": "732330110",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "But either way, thank you so much for agreeing to help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323302",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Azalai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330201": {
            "id": "732330201",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "Huh, so there was another batch after all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330202"
            ]
          },
          "732330202": {
            "id": "732330202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey, about Raef's goods...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330203"
            ]
          },
          "732330203": {
            "id": "732330203",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "Oh, you mean the stuff he ordered from me? Well, you're in luck! The batch of goods I just received has his stuff in there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330204"
            ]
          },
          "732330204": {
            "id": "732330204",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "I must say, though, that he ordered quite a lot of things. Are you here to pick up his order?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330207"
            ]
          },
          "732330207": {
            "id": "732330207",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "Well, apart from that pot, he's also ordered various seeds, fertilizer, and other items used in gardening...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330208"
            ]
          },
          "732330208": {
            "id": "732330208",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "They're pretty weighty when put together. Are you sure you'll be fine by yourself?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323303",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the stuff back to Raef",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330301": {
            "id": "732330301",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Traveler! Have you brought the stuff?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323307",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the stuff back to Raef",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330401": {
            "id": "732330401",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "These are the ones. Thank you so much, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330404"
            ]
          },
          "732330404": {
            "id": "732330404",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Uh, well, I... I just wanted to buy more at once to save myself some extra trips, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330405"
            ]
          },
          "732330405": {
            "id": "732330405",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Anyway, go rest over there for a while. I need to sow these seeds and put some fertilizer in and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330406"
            ]
          },
          "732330406": {
            "id": "732330406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Raef starts working on the flower pot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330407"
            ]
          },
          "732330407": {
            "id": "732330407",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Alright, this should do it! All Nermin needs to do is water this plant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330408"
            ]
          },
          "732330408": {
            "id": "732330408",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Traveler, could I, ah, trouble you to help me bring this flower pot to her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330409"
            ]
          },
          "732330409": {
            "id": "732330409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why don't you go yourself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330410"
            ]
          },
          "732330410": {
            "id": "732330410",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I need to guard this path. If any foodstuffs or goods pass through, I'll need to get more people from the village to come take them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330411"
            ]
          },
          "732330411": {
            "id": "732330411",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "And you know how it is around here. If we're too slow, the goods are going to spoil under the sun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330412"
            ]
          },
          "732330412": {
            "id": "732330412",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Just do me this favor, please. Nermin's not far from here. All you have to do is give this pot of flowers to her. I'll find a way to bring the rest to her."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323304",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the flower pot to Nermin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323305",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nermin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330501": {
            "id": "732330501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Someone inside hears movement...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330502"
            ]
          },
          "732330502": {
            "id": "732330502",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "Hello. May I help you with anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330503"
            ]
          },
          "732330503": {
            "id": "732330503",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, I'm here to give you this flower pot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330504"
            ]
          },
          "732330504": {
            "id": "732330504",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "Huh... Is this from Raef?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330505"
            ]
          },
          "732330505": {
            "id": "732330505",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "There are flowers in this pot? Really? Thank you for helping him send this to me. I like it very much...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330506"
            ]
          },
          "732330506": {
            "id": "732330506",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "But... Can I really raise these flowers properly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330507"
            ]
          },
          "732330507": {
            "id": "732330507",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is it your first time growing flowers?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330508"
            ]
          },
          "732330508": {
            "id": "732330508",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "Well, no. I'm just... not very good at taking care of plants. The previous ones all withered in my hands...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330509"
            ]
          },
          "732330509": {
            "id": "732330509",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "I imagine that this pot of flowers must be even more delicate still. If I were to fail to care for it properly again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330510"
            ]
          },
          "732330510": {
            "id": "732330510",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "Ugh, no, no, I can't just... Since the flowers are already in my hands, I must take good care of it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330511"
            ]
          },
          "732330511": {
            "id": "732330511",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "Perhaps Granny Kulsoom knows how to solve this problem..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323306",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Raef",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330601": {
            "id": "732330601",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "You're back, Traveler. Thank you so much for helping out... How is Nermin doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330603",
              "732330606"
            ]
          },
          "732330603": {
            "id": "732330603",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Well... I'll help her look into this. If all else fails, we'll find someone to ask about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330604"
            ]
          },
          "732330604": {
            "id": "732330604",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "And if even that fails... I'll just... look for something that's easy to grow and keep alive, I guess.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330608"
            ]
          },
          "732330608": {
            "id": "732330608",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Well, in any case, thanks for helping me out, Traveler. Please, take this as your reward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330609"
            ]
          },
          "732330609": {
            "id": "732330609",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I'll send the other items to her later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330610"
            ]
          },
          "732330610": {
            "id": "732330610",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Wait a moment. Did these gardening tools not come with instruction manuals? ...Oh no. I have no idea how to use them!"
          },
          "732330606": {
            "id": "732330606",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "Well, I wouldn't say that exactly, but the ones I would ask people to help me buy for her were already fully-grown. By the time they arrived in the village, they were nearly all dried out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732330607"
            ]
          },
          "732330607": {
            "id": "732330607",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "That's why I decided that I would send her a freshly planted pot of flowers this time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323307",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330701": {
            "id": "732330701",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I do hope that Nermin can get better soon..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323308",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330801": {
            "id": "732330801",
            "speakerId": 4406,
            "speakerName": "Azalai",
            "text": "Strange, where's that other batch of goods?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323309",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732330901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732330901": {
            "id": "732330901",
            "speakerId": 4404,
            "speakerName": "Raef",
            "text": "I... Did I buy too many things...?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7323310",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732331001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732331001": {
            "id": "732331001",
            "speakerId": 4405,
            "speakerName": "Nermin",
            "text": "If these flowers needs to be watered every day, just how much water will I need by the end?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}